Package: bhola-pulse
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Łukasz Budzynowski <lbudzynowski@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), conky-all, x11-xserver-utils, libx11-6
Recommends: iputils-ping, nftables
Homepage: https://github.com/lbudzynowski/bhola-pulse
Description: animated system telemetry dashboard for Ubuntu GNOME
 Bhola Pulse is a transparent multi-monitor Conky dashboard with a single
 Python telemetry provider, atomic JSON cache, modern and terminal-inspired
 renderers, bounded network probes, and privacy-preserving local status data.
